From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 11:44:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add voice input to the Add memory composer

- Wire the existing voiceCapture module into step 1
- Live transcript fills the text box; recording capped at 60s
- Play back or remove the take; shown again on the review step
- Voice-only memories allowed (text minimum applies without audio)
- Cancel the microphone on close; hide the button if unsupported
- Tests for the voice flow
